{"gene":"MYC","uniprot":"P01106","proteinName":"myc proto-oncogene protein isoform 1","function":"Transcription factor that binds DNA in a non-specific manner, yet also specifically recognizes the core sequence 5'-CAC[GA]TG-3'. Activates the transcription of growth-related genes. Binds to the VEGFA promoter, promoting VEGFA production and subsequent sprouting angiogenesis. Regulator of somatic reprogramming, controls self-renewal of embryonic stem cells. Functions with TAF6L to activate target gene expression through RNA polymerase II pause release. Positively regulates transcription of HNRNPA1, HNRNPA2 and PTBP1 which in turn regulate splicing of pyruvate kinase PKM by binding repressively to sequences flanking PKM exon 9, inhibiting exon 9 inclusion and resulting in exon 10 inclusion and production of the PKM M2 isoform","pathwayComment":null,"pathways":[{"id":"R-HSA-1280218","name":"Adaptive Immune System","evidence":"TAS","depth":2,"top":false},{"id":"R-HSA-418990","name":"Adherens junctions interactions","evidence":"TAS","depth":4,"top":false},{"id":"R-HSA-69278","name":"Cell Cycle, Mitotic","evidence":"TAS","depth":2,"top":false},{"id":"R-HSA-446728","name":"Cell junction organization","evidence":"TAS","depth":2,"top":false},{"id":"R-HSA-421270","name":"Cell-cell junction organization","evidence":"TAS","depth":3,"top":false},{"id":"R-HSA-9711123","name":"Cellular response to chemical stress","evidence":"TAS","depth":3,"top":false},{"id":"R-HSA-2262752","name":"Cellular responses to stress","evidence":"TAS","depth":2,"top":false},{"id":"R-HSA-389948","name":"Co-inhibition by PD-1","evidence":"TAS","depth":4,"top":false},{"id":"R-HSA-69656","name":"Cyclin A:Cdk2-associated events at S phase entry","evidence":"TAS","depth":4,"top":false},{"id":"R-HSA-1280215","name":"Cytokine Signaling in Immune system","evidence":"TAS","depth":2,"top":false},{"id":"R-HSA-5688426","name":"Deubiquitination","evidence":"TAS","depth":3,"top":false},{"id":"R-HSA-5663202","name":"Dise